{"4999270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Shell", "steam_appid": 4999270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Shell</strong> is a very challenging top down shooter, compete with other players to be on the top leaderboard, or just try to see how far you can make it in this Perma death action shooter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999270/extras/22e924233a368e5c4c015e54ee40deb4.avif?t=1786026875\" width=1033 height=285 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op</strong> max of two player, work with a friend to try and get a high-score. this mode is more challenging as you don't start with as many ship parts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999270/extras/436137c5b053cb0ae593ea1a19e5856a.avif?t=1786026875\" width=854 height=296 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> after every round/level there is a trader offering goods for your points, get better weapons or ship upgrades to survive longer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999270/extras/0d3e5e75a2813b14aea4002ca5c048c4.avif?t=1786026875\" width=527 height=258 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creatures </strong>each level change and have very different movement and attacks that changes how you have to adapt,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999270/extras/6e71934092838f981f5185bd0493d73d.avif?t=1786026875\" width=841 height=216 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ship Dashboard</strong> will have the leaderboard on the top left so you can track real-time other player scores, and on the top right is your ships communications.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999270/extras/9ec59b2749aa3efac88d42e9a6f131e1.avif?t=1786026875\" width=798 height=227 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Damaging</strong> instead of death after one hit the lives are how much of your ship is left. when you get hit you get weaker so be very careful of how you play.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmic Shell</strong> is a very challenging top down shooter, compete with other players to be on the top leaderboard, or just try to see how far you can make it in this Perma death action shooter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999270/extras/22e924233a368e5c4c015e54ee40deb4.avif?t=1786026875\" width=1033 height=285 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op</strong> max of two player, work with a friend to try and get a high-score. this mode is more challenging as you don't start with as many ship parts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999270/extras/436137c5b053cb0ae593ea1a19e5856a.avif?t=1786026875\" width=854 height=296 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> after every round/level there is a trader offering goods for your points, get be